  {
    "id": 678,
    "date": "2018-04-07T16:41:55+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "I am in the middle of nowhere, but it is very scenic.  People actually live in Dajt ... houses way up the side of the hill.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 679,
    "date": "2018-04-08T07:18:48+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Last night's camp spot near Dajt ...",
    "media": "679.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 680,
    "date": "2018-04-08T12:34:36+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Tonight at hostel in Tirane ... need to do laundry and take hot shower ...",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 681,
    "date": "2018-04-09T12:39:50+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "On the road again ...",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 689,
    "date": "2018-04-09T14:12:26+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Presently here ... where I will camp.",
    "media": "689.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 690,
    "date": "2018-04-09T14:14:17+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Behind me now ... I was here at this same spot about a month ago ... but did not camp then.",
    "media": "690.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 691,
    "date": "2018-04-09T14:15:49+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Crazy deep dark caves and tunnels everywhere in Albania ...",
    "media": "691.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 692,
    "date": "2018-04-09T14:57:16+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Kos and sardines ...",
    "media": "692.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 693,
    "date": "2018-04-09T15:43:47+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Solitude with 270 degree views, and pine trees ...",
    "media": "693.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 694,
    "date": "2018-04-09T15:45:36+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Ready for campfire tonight ...",
    "media": "694.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 695,
    "date": "2018-04-09T16:10:31+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "20 dollar China tent has performed well ... over about 30 nights so far ... it just requires that one be gentle with it ...",
    "media": "695.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 696,
    "date": "2018-04-09T17:00:42+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "If I can locate a source for drinking water, I could stay a long time.  It sounds like there is a stream down below ...",
    "media": "696.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 697,
    "date": "2018-04-11T07:55:05+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Spent 2 nights camping at the site above. Now making my way toward Durrës to ride ferry to Bari, Italy.\n\nIn Bari, I will meet with my older brother (74) John, who will be vacationing there with his family. I don't believe I've seen John for 20 years ...",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 699,
    "date": "2018-04-11T08:04:59+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "My brother John and his wife Ann, Athens, 2006",
    "media": "699.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 706,
    "date": "2018-04-11T11:59:34+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Back in Durrës again, for the fourth time.",
    "media": "706.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 708,
    "date": "2018-04-12T10:31:39+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "New bottom bracket\n8 usd installed",
    "media": "708.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 709,
    "date": "2018-04-12T10:31:47+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Bike shop\nRruga Glaukia, Durrës\n\nhttps://maps.google.com/?q=41.326052,19.455532",
    "media": "709.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 711,
    "date": "2018-04-13T11:06:01+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Checked into Durrës hostel for tonight. Will work on Koompi document, wash clothes, last night in Albania before boarding ferry to Italy.  Same Durrës hostel as before.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 712,
    "date": "2018-04-13T11:08:43+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "As before, Hostel Durrës, located here:\n\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/Pu2Hof7JC5H2\n\nHostel price up from 7 € previously, to 9 € now.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 713,
    "date": "2018-04-13T11:11:07+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Changed 100 usd to 81.00 euro ... 1.23 exchange rate.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 716,
    "date": "2018-04-14T17:21:29+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Boarding ferry to Italy ...",
    "media": "716.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 717,
    "date": "2018-04-14T17:37:22+00:00",
    "from": "thonthavry",
    "text": "",
    "media": "717.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 718,
    "date": "2018-04-14T17:37:33+00:00",
    "from": "thonthavry",
    "text": "I'm in Stockholm at the moment.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 719,
    "date": "2018-04-14T17:53:30+00:00",
    "from": "thonthavry",
    "text": "Things are expensive here.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 720,
    "date": "2018-04-14T18:08:16+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Is it cold? Albania must be the most inexpensive place in the world.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 721,
    "date": "2018-04-14T18:08:31+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Leaving port in 2 hours. Outdoor deck seat.  Might be cold and wet ...",
    "media": "721.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 722,
    "date": "2018-04-14T18:12:36+00:00",
    "from": "thonthavry",
    "text": "Very cold for may weather I ever experienced while in Czech",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 723,
    "date": "2018-04-14T18:12:59+00:00",
    "from": "thonthavry",
    "text": "But very refreshing after being in a hot country for long time.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 724,
    "date": "2018-04-14T18:15:22+00:00",
    "from": "thonthavry",
    "text": "8:15pm still light.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 725,
    "date": "2018-04-14T18:34:24+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "We are in the same time zone, but you are so far north.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 726,
    "date": "2018-04-14T18:35:08+00:00",
    "from": "thonthavry",
    "text": "",
    "media": "726.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 727,
    "date": "2018-04-14T18:35:16+00:00",
    "from": "thonthavry",
    "text": "Still icy lakes and snow",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 728,
    "date": "2018-04-14T21:20:30+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Finally leaving port - 80 minutes late.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 729,
    "date": "2018-04-14T21:32:30+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Going to lose cell service soon - until I buy new simm card in Italy ...",
    "media": "729.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 730,
    "date": "2018-04-17T09:03:21+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Arrive Bari, Italy",
    "media": "730.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 731,
    "date": "2018-04-17T09:03:21+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "The port ... cloudy day.",
    "media": "731.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 732,
    "date": "2018-04-17T09:03:31+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Campsite in Alberobello District.\n\n2 nights",
    "media": "732.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 733,
    "date": "2018-04-17T09:03:42+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Masseria Papaperta\nAlberobello, Italy\n\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/QUJ72q9rvDk",
    "media": "733.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 734,
    "date": "2018-04-17T09:05:10+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Here now:\nNoci, Italy\n\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/vnjJQfCrtfC2\n\nNice outdoor market.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 736,
    "date": "2018-04-17T09:15:57+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Enjoying the food?",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 737,
    "date": "2018-04-17T09:29:34+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Alberobello is beautiful.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 738,
    "date": "2018-04-17T10:08:37+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Alberobello - very unusual for sure. Can't afford to eat in restaurants ... but did have one restaurant meal with my brother.  Excellent, of course, with red wine.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 739,
    "date": "2018-04-17T10:10:49+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Leaving Noci now.",
    "media": null
  },
