    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 746,
    "date": "2018-04-18T14:34:32+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "A cyclist could make a fortune in Italy collecting hubcaps from the side of the road and reselling them internationally.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 747,
    "date": "2018-04-19T10:13:34+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "",
    "media": "747.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 748,
    "date": "2018-04-19T10:44:49+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "More road kill in Italy than I've seen anywhere, mostly cats.\n\nItalians are big into roadside dumping, even though there are recycling and trash receptacles in all urban areas.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 749,
    "date": "2018-04-19T10:46:22+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Wow look so beautiful",
    "media": null
  },
