    "id": 774,
    "date": "2018-04-20T07:46:19+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Two old woman demanded I leave their vacant land immediately. First time this ever happened anywhere in the world.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 775,
    "date": "2018-04-20T08:37:59+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Some Italian people are unwelcoming in many respects.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 776,
    "date": "2018-04-20T08:37:59+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "That's why the youth reject the church - they see their elders as hypocrites ....",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 777,
    "date": "2018-04-20T08:38:00+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "",
    "media": "777.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 778,
    "date": "2018-04-20T08:38:02+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "",
    "media": "778.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 780,
    "date": "2018-04-20T09:25:23+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "You must always be on edge with Italians, because one may strike at you at any moment.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 781,
    "date": "2018-04-20T09:25:23+00:00",
    "from": "unknown",
    "text": "Riding into strong headwinds all day is more tiring than riding through mountains ...",
